    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the next-generation Multi Player shooter game experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Legends puts you in powerful weapons as you in an extreme open environment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set players into teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome, hide and dodge enemies while shooting enemies and increasing your score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Face extreme environment in a highly advanced physics engine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 3 extreme weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health and Aumo spread around the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Go solo with a team or play with other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This game makes the enjoyment of war battle third person shooter game in the way experiencing war in a exciting environment.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should expect multiplayer or computer teammates in the game mode and the winning team are the team who has more kills of the game with time limit where you can enjoy the game more.\u00a0   <br>- You have multiple carrying weapons and the weapons are spread in the ground fairly (Shotgun, Pistol, Rifle, bullets and health. <br>- The game is inspired by space fighters in a magical world. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for the next-generation Multi Player shooter game experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Legends puts you in powerful weapons as you in an extreme open environment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set players into teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome, hide and dodge enemies while shooting enemies and increasing your score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Face extreme environment in a highly advanced physics engine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 3 extreme weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health and Aumo spread around the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Go solo with a team or play with other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This game makes the enjoyment of war battle third person shooter game in the way experiencing war in a exciting environment.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should expect multiplayer or computer teammates in the game mode and the winning team are the team who has more kills of the game with time limit where you can enjoy the game more.\u00a0   <br>- You have multiple carrying weapons and the weapons are spread in the ground fairly (Shotgun, Pistol, Rifle, bullets and health. <br>- The game is inspired by space fighters in a magical world. </p></li></ul>",
